  "prefLabel": "Fis 1002.07 Consultation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1002.07 “Consultation” means the review by department staff of a proposed action in order to evaluate potential adverse impacts of the proposed action to threatened and endangered species, and the need for conservation measures to avoid, minimize, or mitigate such adverse impacts.\n\nSource. #13313, eff 2-3-22",
